{"3511970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bubble Dome: Pop to the Top!", "steam_appid": 3511970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511970/extras/bbbe297d700ca7c0a917a69b2bc60d9b.poster.avif?t=1780994053\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511970/extras/bbbe297d700ca7c0a917a69b2bc60d9b.webm?t=1780994053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511970/extras/bbbe297d700ca7c0a917a69b2bc60d9b.mp4?t=1780994053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Bubble Dome: Pop to the Top!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubble Dome: Pop to the Top! is a local-multiplayer arena shooter/brawler where players inside of a fish-mechs try to eliminate each other. Charge up and shoot bubbles, jump, evade, and knock your friends out to be the last fish standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Little Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⏰ Small, procedurallay generated levels to knock your friends out!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐟 Charming and colorful fish-mechs to control!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 Play with up to 8 players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🫧 Bubble turrets to add chaos to the fun!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚠️ <strong>Attention: This game is digestible </strong>😋🍴</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>We're <strong>TENSTACK!</strong> A small collective of game makers creating lots of creative and 'digestible' games. A digestible game respects its players' money and time, is designed around a single idea, and doesn’t overstay its welcome. We want you t